{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.qmn_recursive_memoized","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.qmn_recursive_memoized","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Shared.MarkovTraceClaim"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.qmn_recursive_memoized","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.qmn_recursive_memoized","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/qmn_recursive_memoized.lean#L66-L93","doc":"**Proposition statement** (from manuscript):\n\nThe classical Murnaghan-Nakayama rule expresses $\\chi_\\rho^\\lambda$\nrecursively via border-strip removal:*\n\n$$\n  \\chi_\\rho^\\lambda \\;=\\; \\sum_{\\xi \\in BS(\\lambda, \\rho_1)}\n                          (-1)^{\\mathrm{ht}(\\xi)} \\,\n                          \\chi_{\\rho \\setminus \\rho_1}^{\\lambda \\setminus \\xi}\n$$\n\n*where $BS(\\lambda, \\rho_1)$ is the set of border strips of size $\\rho_1$\nin $\\lambda$, $\\mathrm{ht}(\\xi)$ is the height of strip $\\xi$, and\n$\\rho \\setminus \\rho_1$ is $\\rho$ with its first part removed.*\n\n*The\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:qmn-recursive-memoized","label":"prop:qmn-recursive-memoized","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qmn-recursive-memoized.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.claim_iii_stores_result_cache","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.claim_iii_stores_result_cache","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/qmn_recursive_memoized.lean#L64-L64","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (iii) — Cache invariant: when the cache\nreturns a value, it equals the canonical character value (the\nstored result is faithful — no mutation effect). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.cache_get","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.cache_get","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/qmn_recursive_memoized.lean#L60-L60","doc":"Cache lookup operation `cache_get λ ρ` returns `some v` on hit,\n`none` on miss. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.claim_ii_border_strip_recursion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.claim_ii_border_strip_recursion","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/qmn_recursive_memoized.lean#L53-L53","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (ii) — the border-strip recursion: the recursive\nvalue is the signed sum over border strips of size `ρ_1`,\n\n`χ^λ_ρ = Σ_{ξ ∈ BS(λ, ρ_1)} (-1)^{ht(ξ)} · χ^{λ∖ξ}_{ρ∖ρ_1}`.\n\n**This is the Murnaghan–Nakayama rule, written out.**  It was\n`claim_ii_miss_computes_via : Prop` with a `_holds` witness beside\nit — a field typed with the *universe* `Prop`, so the instance chose\nthe proposition and `⟨True, trivial⟩` discharged it.  The docstring\nsaid the recursion \"stays abstract because it requires enumeration of\nborder strips\"; the enumeration is now a field, so it does not. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.chiReduced","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.chiReduced","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/qmn_recursive_memoized.lean#L41-L41","doc":"Character of the reduced pair `χ^{λ ∖ ξ}_{ρ ∖ ρ_1}` — the recursive\ncall's value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.stripHeight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.stripHeight","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/qmn_recursive_memoized.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Height `ht(ξ)` of a border strip, supplying the sign `(-1)^{ht(ξ)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.borderStrips","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.borderStrips","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/qmn_recursive_memoized.lean#L36-L36","doc":"Border strips of size `ρ_1` in `λ`, as the list the recursion sums\nover.  Carrying the enumeration as a field is what lets sub-claim\n(ii) below be *stated*: the recursion's content is the sum, and a sum\nneeds an index set. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.claim_i_looks_up_cache","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.claim_i_looks_up_cache","kind":"theorem","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/qmn_recursive_memoized.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (i) — Cache identity: memoized lookup\nagrees with the recursive computation (the recursion is the\nauthoritative answer). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.chi_recursion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.chi_recursion","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/qmn_recursive_memoized.lean#L27-L27","doc":"Recursion result via border-strip removal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.chi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.chi","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/qmn_recursive_memoized.lean#L25-L25","doc":"Character value `χ^λ_ρ` for partition `λ` and cycle type `ρ`, valued in\nthe inherited coefficient ring `R` of the parent Markov-trace context\n(§7c: the q-character is a Laurent polynomial in `q`, not a real). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/qmn_recursive_memoized.lean#L21-L21","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.toMarkovTraceContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext.toMarkovTraceContext","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/qmn_recursive_memoized.lean#L21-L65","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.QmnRecursiveMemoizedContext","kind":"class","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/qmn_recursive_memoized.lean#L18-L65","doc":"Abstract context for the `qmn_recursive_memoized` claim — manuscript-named\ntyped fields below; the `holds` field carries the `Prop`-valued\nclaim of the lemma. ","signatureChunk":0}]}